{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本標準依消防法第十二條第五項規定訂定之。","id":"D0120049/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"9ffcfde0eef9824019c7e5ef841a340b829960fa95642fb7f0b4578bf62c667f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0120049/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":20,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"消防機具器材及設備之構造、材質、性能、試驗內容及試驗設備，應符合下列共通性質規定：\n一、各部構造及零件之材質、製造及裝配方法應與申請之設計圖相符。\n二、具堅固、安全之構造，不得有傷痕、裂痕、變形、破損、劣化、接觸不良等情形或傷害使用者之虞。\n三、構造具耐久性，零件應安裝正確且不易鬆脫，不得因震動、衝擊產生使用或產品性能之障礙。\n四、使用材質可能銹蝕者，應採取防蝕措施；零件使用非金屬材質者，應為不易變形構造。\n五、試驗內容及試驗設備應依產品設計原理、材質、構造及性能辦理。\n前項消防機具器材及設備之構造、材質、性能、試驗內容及試驗設備之個別性質，應依中央主管機關公告之基準，實施型式認可、型式變更及個別認可試驗。","id":"D0120049/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"1719228b4b5a76ec0cc6a7e7a3a5869d030b71c8436075d29b56e412a6278b92","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0120049/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":238,"children":[{"id":"D0120049/a:2/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":42,"end":74,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:2/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":74,"end":121,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:2/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":121,"end":165,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:2/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":165,"end":206,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:2/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":206,"end":238,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0120049/a:2/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":238,"end":307,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"型式認可、型式變更及個別認可試驗發現之缺點，依下列規定之等級判定之：\n一、致命缺點：對人體有危害之虞或無法達到消防機具器材及設備之應有功能者。\n二、嚴重缺點：雖非致命缺點，但對消防機具器材及設備之功能有產生重大障礙之虞者。\n三、一般缺點：非致命缺點或嚴重缺點。但對消防機具器材及設備之功能有產生障礙之虞；或產品構造與認可之型式有異；或標示錯誤，致使用功能產生障礙之虞者。\n四、輕微缺點：非屬前三款規定之輕微障礙。\n同時有不同等級之缺點者，分別列入不同等級之缺點；同時有二項以上相同等級之缺點者，以同一等級缺點計算。","id":"D0120049/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"422de714df3126de14da4f2c9ba745d6bfa5bcf54f9e7b17b570c98a9beb5018","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0120049/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":207,"children":[{"id":"D0120049/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":35,"end":72,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":72,"end":112,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:3/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":112,"end":186,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:3/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":186,"end":207,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0120049/a:3/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":207,"end":257,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"型式認可、型式變更或個別認可試驗時，發現有可修補之缺點或試驗設備故障等不影響產品性能者，得辦理補正試驗，並以一次為限。\n型式認可、型式變更試驗結果符合中央主管機關公告之基準者，判定合格。\n第一項項個別認可補正試驗應依原試驗等級重新採樣，補正試驗數量應扣除第一次試驗數量中之預備品及不良品。\n個別認可之抽樣試驗等級為第五條第二項所定最嚴格試驗者，經試驗不合格時，不得進行補正試驗。","id":"D0120049/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"c32572954755e3e4aab68e956579d63c580f0a76d9e4a2a1475e73470ca03c67","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0120049/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":60,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:4/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":60,"end":94,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:4/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":94,"end":145,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:4/p:4","kind":"paragraph","number":4,"start":145,"end":189,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"個別認可依消防機具器材及設備之品目、試驗項目及數量，辦理抽樣試驗。\n前項個別認可抽樣試驗等級，依程度分為寬鬆試驗、普通試驗、嚴格試驗及最嚴格試驗，試驗嚴寬等級之調整如附表。\n第一項個別認可依國家標準（CNS） 九○四二隨機抽樣法及下列各款規定進行抽樣試驗。但生產或進口數量較少者，得適用少量生產或少量進口之普通試驗：\n一、第一次申請個別認可應以普通試驗為之，依試驗結果，決定下一批試驗之等級。\n二、有輕微變更者，依變更前之試驗等級進行試驗。\n三、試驗設備或場所有變更時，依下列規定辦理：\n（一）試驗等級依變更前之等級進行試驗。\n（二）需調整試驗等級之批次，以變更後之批次數重新計算之。","id":"D0120049/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"b21c7e3970f621a4ad8027040f741d5bb9c85114f79a1170b245136dfcaad543","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0120049/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":34,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:5/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":34,"end":87,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:5/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":87,"end":292,"children":[{"id":"D0120049/a:5/p:3/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":159,"end":197,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:5/p:3/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":197,"end":221,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:5/p:3/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":221,"end":292,"children":[{"id":"D0120049/a:5/p:3/i:3/s:1","kind":"subitem","number":1,"start":244,"end":264,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:5/p:3/i:3/s:2","kind":"subitem","number":2,"start":264,"end":292,"children":[]}]}]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"個別認可符合下列規定者，得實施免會同試驗：\n一、達寬鬆試驗後連續十批第一次試驗均合格。\n二、累積受驗合格數量達中央主管機關公告之基準所定數量以上。\n三、取得國際標準組織（ISO） 九○○一認可登錄。\n實施免會同試驗之品目，登錄機構應每半年派員會同實施抽樣試驗一次；抽樣試驗結果不符合中央主管機關公告之基準者，該批次判定不合格，且次批次恢復為普通試驗。\n符合免會同試驗資格之品目，有下列情形之一者，應恢復為普通試驗：\n一、廠內試驗紀錄不實。\n二、未申請個別認可達六個月以上。\n三、取得認可標示之產品不符本標準或中央主管機關公告之基準，經登錄機構查證屬實者。","id":"D0120049/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"92579b4c6d4ece5a3c866be20cef3263ddcef2cf7b67da4fd84ed9379ba1d52b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0120049/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":100,"children":[{"id":"D0120049/a:6/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":22,"end":44,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:6/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":44,"end":74,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:6/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":74,"end":100,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0120049/a:6/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":100,"end":176,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:6/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":176,"end":277,"children":[{"id":"D0120049/a:6/p:3/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":208,"end":220,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:6/p:3/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":220,"end":237,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:6/p:3/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":237,"end":277,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"個別認可批次依受驗廠商、消防機具器材及設備品目、試驗等級認定之。\n申請者不得指定將某部分產品列為同一批次。\n個別認可應於該批次試驗完成後，始得實施下一批次試驗。","id":"D0120049/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"7777789b492ed704695057cc316fd88e66b24e9d12955e74e0c8ee86b381d48d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0120049/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":33,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:7/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":33,"end":54,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:7/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":54,"end":80,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"個別認可試驗批次合格與否，依產品試驗之缺點等級及樣品數判定如下：\n一、不良品數目在合格判定之不良品數目上限（以下簡稱 Ac） 以下時，判定合格。\n二、不良品數目在 Ac 與不合格判定之不良品數目下限（以下簡稱 Re）之間，判定合格。\n三、不良品在 Re 以上，其為初次試驗者，得於下次補正試驗；其為補正試驗者，判定不合格。\n四、前三款試驗結果，發現不良品有致命缺點者，其不良品數雖在 Ac 以下，判定不合格。\n五、試驗合格之樣品批次中，發現有缺點之樣品，能以預備品替換或可調整、修理者，視為良品；預備品不足或無法調整、修理者，其有缺點之試樣均視為不良品。\n六、試驗過程試驗設備異常或故障，無法如期完成時，試驗應即停止，其為初次試驗者，得補正試驗；其為補正試驗者，判定不合格。","id":"D0120049/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"831cdb86c2237b0594ff476c17f7ad6be02b5a1e2f479a4e37bd2e4bd07b6ebe","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0120049/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":337,"children":[{"id":"D0120049/a:8/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":33,"end":73,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:8/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":73,"end":117,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:8/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":117,"end":162,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:8/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":162,"end":205,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:8/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":205,"end":278,"children":[]},{"id":"D0120049/a:8/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":278,"end":337,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"本標準施行日期，由中央主管機關定之。","id":"D0120049/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"6fc7657d5ab8747aacb9162ae3b095b543a86e80da839151808cf48741eec0b7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0120049/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":18,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[{"title":"附表：試驗嚴寬度等級之調整.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000229246"},{"title":"附表：試驗嚴寬度等級之調整.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000113595"}],"category":"消防與公共安全","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國一百零一年六月二十一日內政部台內消字第 1010820732 號令\n  訂定發布全文 9  條；施行日期，由中央主管機關定之\n  中華民國一百零二年六月二十日內政部台內消字第 1020823577 號令發\n  布定自一百零二年七月一日施行","id":"D0120049","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2012-06-21","name":"消防機具器材及設備認可標準","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0120049","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"9e595138230b48b5a8092066e13e86ea9e3a53655bbdd00aba652e227185c04a","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2012-06-21","effectiveDate":""}}